{"id":"HAD-0085","language":"de","narratorLine":"Abū Mūsā al-Ašʿarī berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"**Wer die beiden kühlen Gebete verrichtet, wird das Paradies betreten.**","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Nr. 574","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"Ebenfalls in Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim, Nr. 635."}